# A.K.I.R.A.

Agentic Knowledge Integration & Retrieval Architecture. ARMS: Apps (FastAPI), Routines (LangGraph), Memory (Neo4j), Skills (FastMCP).

- React only talks HTTP/SSE to FastAPI. Never MCP. Never Neo4j.
- Only `backend/app/arms/memory/` speaks Bolt/Cypher.
- MCP servers in `backend/mcp_servers/` must not import LangGraph or FastAPI.
- HTTP contracts live in `backend/app/api/schemas.py`. Do not invent routes.
- No Weaviate, SGLang, OCR, GDS plugin, GDS cosine, Next.js, FAISS, secrets in code.
- LLM: OpenAI default + Ollama via `LLM_PROVIDER` / `EMBEDDINGS_PROVIDER`.
- Code/file names in English. User-facing messages in Portuguese.
- Do not commit unless the user asks.
- Hostname for this project: DESKTOP-PJ9TP90 only. Never NRJ_371.
